{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stellar Archipelago is a third person base builder set in space. Collect resources and develop mini star systems. Place buildings to develop and increase the population of your system. Unlock new buildings by exploring planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump between nearby differently shaped planets<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/JumpBetweenPlanets.png?t=1750172991\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to construct buildings<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/Screenshot__664_.png?t=1750172991\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new buildings as you explore<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/Screenshot__638_.png?t=1750172991\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural solar systems \u2013  develop new systems each time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/Screenshot__678_.png?t=1750172991\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295680?t=1750172991","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750172991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/ca517b8f5900b6fcf9d8a1f3070134f01539d45b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750172991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/ca517b8f5900b6fcf9d8a1f3070134